---
// The row of buttons at the bottom of every step, at the right end of the
// column: the way on ("Skip", "Check again"), then the main button. The main
// button comes first in the markup, so that the Enter key presses it, and
// shows last. On a step taller than the screen the row stays in sight at the
// bottom, on a white band with a line above it.
---

<div
  class="sticky bottom-0 z-10 -mx-4 flex flex-row-reverse flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-1.5 border-t border-gray-200 bg-white px-4 py-2"
>
  <slot />
</div>
